  "ruleText": "Rev 601.22 “Final monitoring report” means the DRA’s final letter to the municipality for any revaluation or partial update.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 600) #10581, eff 5-1-14; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (formerly Rev 601.23) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
